  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Gutehey Singh @ Vijay Singh (Actual Name ... vs The State Of U.P And Anr. (Complaint ... on 6 January, 2020 Author: Dinesh Kumar Singh Bench: Dinesh Kumar Singh High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad, Lucknow Bench ?Court No. - 13 Case :- U/S 482/378/407 No. - 151 of 2013 Applicant :- Gutehey Singh @ Vijay Singh (Actual Name Vijay Pratap Singh)",
    "facts": "Before filing the complaint under Section 7/16 of the Prevention of Food Adulteration Act, an FIR was registered at Case Crime No.2 of 2011, under Sections 272 and 273 IPC, Police Station Kaiserganj, District Bahraich against the petitioner and one Tabrej, who was the owner of the restaurant from where the sample of packaged drinking water was seized. The police did not find any involvement of the petitioner in that FIR and, therefore, charge sheet was filed only against Tabrej and not against the petitioner.",
